description: Keep replies short — one step, dialog format, no walls of text
alwaysApply: true
---

# Short dialog responses

- A few short paragraphs or ~5–10 bullets. No long guides unless the user asks for a doc.
- One turn = one focus. Answer the immediate question only.
- Prefer 1–3 concrete steps or facts, then stop.
- At most one optional follow-up — or none.
- **Russian** for user-facing chat.
- Code changes: still do the work; the explanation stays short.
